<section class="feature-band"><div class="container feature-grid"><div class="feature-photo-wrap"><img class="feature-photo" src="~/images/elderly_care_belagavi_1786088760571.jpg" alt="A caregiver offering attentive companionship to an older woman" loading="lazy" /><div class="feature-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> A person-first approach</div></div><div class="feature-content"><span class="eyebrow">A more reassuring way to care</span><h2>Start with what your family needs.</h2><p>Finding care can feel overwhelming. Our team can listen, help you understand which service to ask about and explain what details are needed to check availability.</p><ul class="check-list"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><span>Talk through the patient's situation and your priorities</span></li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><span>Understand the service scope and what needs confirmation</span></li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><span>Coordinate the next step with a local Belagavi contact</span></li></ul><a class="button button-primary" href="#contact">Talk with our team <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-white"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>A clear first step.<br />A conversation that listens.</h2></div><p>We confirm details with you before any care or service is arranged.</p></div><div class="steps"><article class="step"><span class="step-number">01 / CONNECT</span><h3>Tell us what is happening</h3><p>Call or send a callback request. Share the service you are looking for and your area.</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">02 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Talk through the details</h3><p>We discuss the patient's needs, preferred timing and questions relevant to that service.</p></article><article class="step"><span class="step-number">03 / CONFIRM</span><h3>Agree on the next step</h3><p>Our team confirms availability, scope and any arrangements directly with you.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="faq-section section"><div class="container faq-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Common questions</span><h2>Good to know<br />before you enquire.</h2><p>Have a question about a specific service? Our team can help you identify the right enquiry.</p><a class="text-link" href="tel:+919632554468">Call +91 96325 54468 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Which areas do you serve?</summary><p>We coordinate healthcare enquiries in Belagavi, Karnataka, including Angol, Bhagya Nagar and surrounding neighbourhoods. Please share your location so we can confirm service availability.</p></details><details><summary>How do I know which service to request?</summary><p>Call us or use the callback form and describe what support you are looking for. We can discuss whether your enquiry is for ongoing nursing, daily elder care, a scheduled home visit, equipment, staffing or patient transportation.</p></details><details><summary>Are listed services and equipment always available?</summary><p>Availability depends on location, timing and the specific request. Equipment examples on this site are categories to ask about, not a confirmed inventory. Our team will confirm details before an arrangement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I book an emergency ambulance here?</summary><p>This website supports enquiries about scheduled patient transportation, not a confirmed emergency response service. For a medical emergency in India, call 112 or contact the nearest emergency service.</p></details><details><summary>What should I have ready when I call?</summary><p>It helps to have the patient's name, your callback number, the area, the type of support needed and preferred timing. Share only the medical details needed to discuss the enquiry.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-contact" id="contact"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><span class="eyebrow">We are here to help</span><h2>Let&apos;s talk about the care you need.</h2><p>Reach our Belagavi team to ask about a service, current availability or the next step for your family.</p><div class="contact-detail"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i><div><strong>Call our care team</strong><a href="tel:+919632554468">+91 96325 54468</a><a href="tel:+919739213907">+91 97392 113907</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i><div><strong>WhatsApp</strong><a href="https://wa.me/919632554468" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message our team</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i><div><strong>Email</strong><a href="mailto:homecare@subramanyafoundation.com">homecare@subramanyafoundation.com</a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i><div><strong>Belagavi, Karnataka</strong><span>Angol, Bhagya Nagar and surrounding neighbourhoods</span></div></div></div>
<form class="care-form" id="careForm" onsubmit="submitCareForm(event)">@Html.AntiForgeryToken()<h3>Request a call back</h3><p>Tell us who to contact and which service you would like to discuss.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field"><label for="Name">Your name *</label><input id="Name" name="Name" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" required /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="Phone">Phone number *</label><input id="Phone" name="Phone" type="tel" maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel" required /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="Email">Email address *</label><input id="Email" name="Email" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" required /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="PatientName">Patient name *</label><input id="PatientName" name="PatientName" maxlength="120" required /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="Location">Area in Belagavi</label><input id="Location" name="Location" maxlength="160" placeholder="e.g. Tilakwadi" /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="RequiredService">Service *</label><select id="RequiredService" name="RequiredService" required><option value="Home Nursing Care">Home nursing care</option><option value="Old Age Care">Old age care</option><option value="Ambulance Service">Patient transportation</option><option value="Surgical Material Rental">Medical equipment rental</option><option value="Hospital Staffing">Hospital staff supply</option><option value="Patient Visit">Doctor or nurse home visit</option></select></div><div class="form-field honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="Website">Website</label><input id="Website" name="Website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></div></div><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Send care request <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button><div class="form-result" id="formResult" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><small class="form-note">For emergencies, call 112. This form is for service enquiries and callback requests.</small></form></div></section>
